<% content_for :page_title, "Automated mail delivery" %>
<main class="dd-workspace">
  <header class="dd-page-header"><div><span class="dd-eyebrow">Lightek Mail / delivery</span><h1>Automated mail delivery</h1><p>Password resets, receipts, invitations and account notices use the application’s transactional mail transport.</p></div><%= link_to "Open Mail", dashboard_mail_path, class: "dd-button" %></header>
  <section class="dd-panel"><div class="dd-panel-header"><div><h2>Current route</h2><p>Inbox mail and automated mail share Lightek’s SMTP settings when Lightek SMTP is active.</p></div><span class="dd-status" data-tone="<%= @lightek_smtp ? 'success' : 'warning' %>"><%= @lightek_smtp ? 'Lightek SMTP active' : @delivery_method.humanize %></span></div>
    <p>Transport: <code><%= @delivery_method %></code></p>
    <% if @lightek_smtp %><p>SMTP endpoint: <code><%= @transport[:address] %>:<%= @transport[:port] %></code></p><p class="dd-note">An SMTP acceptance confirms submission to the server. Confirm the message arrives before retiring the old credential.</p><div class="dd-form-actions"><%= button_to "Send delivery check to me", test_dashboard_mail_transport_path, method: :post, class: "dd-button dd-btn-primary" %><small>Sent only to <%= current_user.email_address %>.</small></div><% else %><p class="dd-note">This check requires Lightek SMTP to be active. Explicit HTTPS relay and custom SMTP settings are preserved.</p><% end %>
  </section>
  <section class="dd-panel"><div class="dd-panel-header"><div><h2>Retire Gmail delivery</h2><p>The legacy credential stays available until you confirm a successful Lightek delivery check.</p></div><span class="dd-status"><%= @gmail_secret.nil? ? 'No legacy credential' : @gmail_secret.disabled? ? 'Credential disabled' : 'Credential still stored' %></span></div>
    <% if @probe["reference"].present? %><p>Check reference: <code><%= @probe["reference"] %></code></p><p>Recipient: <%= @probe["recipient"] %></p><%= form_with url: retire_gmail_dashboard_mail_transport_path, method: :post, class: "dd-form-stack" do %><label><%= check_box_tag :received, "1", false, required: true %> I received the message with this reference.</label><%= submit_tag "Confirm receipt & disable Gmail credential", class: "dd-button dd-button-danger" %><% end %><% else %><p>Send a delivery check first. No Gmail credentials are opened by this page.</p><% end %>
  </section>
</main>
